OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested over stabbing in
OL,4,Apark
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fstabbing in a park in Warwickshire.
OL,9,FThe attack happened at Caldecott Park
OL,10,Fin Rugby at about 00:44 GMT on Sunday,
OL,11,FWarwickshire Police said, and a man in
OL,12,Fhis 20s was taken to hospital.
OL,14,FThe park has been closed while
OL,15,Finvestigations take place and officers
OL,16,Fremain in the area to guard the scene,
OL,17,Fthe force added.
OL,19,FThe arrested pair, aged 22 and 23, were
OL,20,Fbeing held on suspicion of assault
OL,21,Fcausing grievous bodily harm.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
